% There is an infinite path. The witness for this property is a single lasso, but the parity game
% has a single priority, which is the case in which the strategy computed by the symbolic solver
% degenerates into the full relation. Without determinization of that strategy the second
% (evidence) instantiation of pbessolvesymbolic re-explores the whole game explicitly.
%
% Used both on abp, where the lasso is long, and on self_loop.mcrl2, where the self-loop is by
% itself a winning move so the witness is a single state.
nu X. <true>X
